Packages and versions (installed unmodified from PyPI with hash checks, see
requirements-openbb-linux-py312.lock; no OpenBB source file is copied or
changed in this repository):
  openbb-core 2.0.1, openbb-cboe 2.0.0, openbb-cftc 2.0.0,
  openbb-famafrench 2.0.0, openbb-federal-reserve 2.0.0, openbb-finra 2.0.0,
  openbb-government-us 2.0.0, openbb-oecd 2.0.0, openbb-sec 2.0.0

Use: vertex_openbb calls the provider fetchers and helper functions of these
packages at runtime. At runtime it replaces the User-Agent header of requests
to *.sec.gov (it does not edit the installed files).

