Data terms (per source, unchanged by OpenBB's license): Cboe delayed data for
personal, non-commercial use; CFTC, Federal Reserve, U.S. Treasury, SEC and
FINRA public data (SEC fair access: declared User-Agent, at most 10 requests
per second); FRED series as published by their owners (ICE BofA spreads under
ICE terms); OECD data and the Kenneth R. French Data Library with attribution.
No paid provider is used.
